rl":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":26,"created_at":"2024-12-22T19:16:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T17:20:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100749","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100749.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100749.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Supersedes #89660\r\n\r\nIn contrast to the above PR, which attempted to simultaneously support C++17 alongside later standards, this PR aims to make our baseline C++20 outright. The *immediate* benefit is removing the need for several workarounds via macros & `#if __cplusplus` wrappers, making for a much cleaner codebase overall. The much, much bigger benefit is the freedom to actually *integrate* C++20 features, allowing this PR to satisfy our contribution Best Practices & not exist as a solution looking for a problem.\r\n\r\n**EDIT:** After a core meeting, it was instead decided that integrations of features would be best handled in entirely separate PRs, so that we can pick-and-choose which features are best to integrate. While that dampens the effect of this PR in isolation, it's now doing so with the knowledge that it will not exist in isolation and would soon be followed with proper integrations of the new features that the repo would directly benefit from. Future edits of this OP will point to specific discussions/implementations of said features up until this is merged.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100749/reactions","total_count":77,"+1":45,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":10,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":20},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100749/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}